This tiddler is used to configure the "Link-to-tabs" plugin behaviour.

There are 4 fields, which are used by [[$:/plugins/wikilabs/link-to-tabs/styles]] enable and disable the internal links.

* show-all-links: {{!!show-all-links}}
* show-single-link: {{!!show-single-link}}
* initial-opacity: {{!!initial-opacity}}
* transition time in seconds: {{!!transition}}
* shadow-action: {{!!shadow-action}} (`tm-edit-tiddler`: clicking a tab-link opens every existing tiddler in edit mode)
